@* The act on this page wants a recent proof, and the person has not given one yet: say so and send
   them to the one page that takes every credential the account holds, with the way back. The
   filter behind [RequireRecentProof] still refuses the POST without it - this is the courtesy, not
   the control. *@
@model string
<p class="form-text">@Localiser["StepUp_ConfirmFirstWhy"]</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" asp-page="/Account/Reauthenticate" asp-route-returnUrl="@Model">@Localiser["StepUp_ConfirmFirst"]</a>
